{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27294992","formula":"C₂₀H₁₇ClN₃O₃P","hill":"C20H17ClN3O3P","elements":["H","C","N","O","P","Cl"],"composition":{"C":20.0,"H":17.0,"N":3.0,"O":3.0,"P":1.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Fosdevirine","ru":"Фосдевирин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Fosdevirine is an experimental antiviral agent of the non-nucleoside reverse transcriptase inhibitor class that was studied for potential use in the treatment of HIV-AIDS. It was discovered by Idenix Pharmaceuticals and was being developed by GlaxoSmithKline and ViiV Healthcare, but it has now been discontinued due to unexpected side effects.","ru":"Фосдевирин — противовирусный препарат класса ненуклеозидных ингибиторов обратной транскриптазы, которое изучалось на предмет потенциального использования при лечении ВИЧ-СПИДа. Препарат был обнаружен компанией «Idenix Pharmaceuticals» и разрабатывался «GlaxoSmithKline» и «ViiV Healthcare», но сейчас данные разработки прекращены из-за неожиданных побочных эффектов."},"fame":3,"pubchemCid":44224276,"mass":413.8,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1=CC(=CC(=C1)[P@@](=O)(C2=C(NC3=C2C=C(C=C3)Cl)C(=O)N)OC)/C=C/C#N","inchikey":"CGBYTKOSZYQOPV-CCEZBSFNSA-N","iupac":"5-chloro-3-[[3-[(E)-2-cyanoethenyl]-5-methylphenyl]-methoxyphosphoryl]-1H-indole-2-carboxamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"44224276","atoms":45,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":1.525,"y":-4.513,"z":-1.636,"el":"Cl"},{"x":0.542,"y":1.434,"z":-1.307,"el":"P"},{"x":0.45,"y":0.435,"z":-2.586,"el":"O"},{"x":1.023,"y":2.795,"z":-1.721,"el":"O"},{"x":1.712,"y":3.421,"z":0.679,"el":"O"},{"x":3.066,"y":0.175,"z":1.492,"el":"N"},{"x":3.191,"y":2.9,"z":2.352,"el":"N"},{"x":-4.269,"y":-4.478,"z":1.191,"el":"N"},{"x":1.644,"y":0.585,"z":-0.163,"el":"C"},{"x":1.936,"y":-0.808,"z":-0.162,"el":"C"},{"x":2.353,"y":1.1